<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-eh-version="0.1">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>外来块（已包裹）</title>
    <script type="application/json" id="eh-meta">{"title":"外来块（已包裹）","created":"2026-11-22","tags":["foreign","canonical"],"theme":"default"}</script>
    <script id="eh-runtime" src="./.ehtml/runtime.js" defer></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main id="eh-doc">
      <p data-eh="w0">16 号样本首次保存后的形态：外来内容包在 eh-html 中，ID 往返稳定。</p>
      <eh-html data-eh="w1"><div class="card" style="border:1px solid #ccc"><h3>任意 div 里的标题</h3><p>Arbitrary <u>div</u> content.</p></div></eh-html>
      <eh-html data-eh="w2"><script src="https://cdn.example.invalid/widget.js"></script></eh-html>
      <eh-html data-eh="w3"><iframe height="315" src="https://www.example.com/embed/abc" title="外部 iframe" width="560"></iframe></eh-html>
      <eh-html data-eh="w4"><details><summary>原生 details</summary><p>不是 eh-toggle。</p></details></eh-html>
      <eh-html data-eh="w5"><dl>
  <dt>术语 term</dt>
  <dd>多行外来内容，内部换行与缩进原样保留</dd>
</dl></eh-html>
      <eh-callout data-eh="w6">
        <script type="application/json">{"kind":"info","title":"容器内的外来块"}</script>
        <eh-slot data-eh-slot="0">
          <eh-html data-eh="w7"><video controls="" src="assets/clip.mp4"></video></eh-html>
        </eh-slot>
      </eh-callout>
      <p data-eh="w8">外来块之后的正常段落。</p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
